[32m+[m[32m## 4.0.0 — Runtime packaging and release baseline (2026-10-27)[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m- Bump Maven artifact and Velocity plugin metadata to `4.0.0`.[m
[32m+[m[32m- Add an explicit Spring Boot 4 MVC runtime dependency to the shaded plugin package, targeting the reported missing `WebMvcWebApplicationTypeDeducer` class.[m
[32m+[m[32m- Make HTTP the default listener mode and disable HTTPS by default for initial setup.[m
[32m+[m[32m- Correct the `/api/v1/health` version field to report `4.0.0`.[m
[32m+[m[32m- Add a release checklist and Git tag workflow guide.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m**Validation status:** source/static checks only in the preparation environment. Maven/Java 25 compilation and a real Velocity startup must pass before publishing this release.[m
[32m+[m
